{"id":"000W2I","title":"Yin Yang Circus","author":"JeffWajes","solvedCount":1,"difficulty":5,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-11-16T11:36:44+00:00","posted":"Heute, 09:41 Uhr","rules":"Yin Yang Circus\n\nBy Jeff Wajes\n\nNormal Sudoku rules apply.\n\nShade some cells such that all shaded cells are orthogonally connected, all unshaded cells are orthogonally connected, and no 2x2 area is fully shaded or fully unshaded.\n\nUsing red, green, and blue, color all circles such that:\n\n-Orthogonally adjacent circles are different colors.\n\n-The digit inside a circle appears that many times in circles of that color.\n\n-Circles in shaded cells are not red.\n\n-Circles in unshaded cells are not blue.\n\nDigits in a cage sum to the small clue in the corner of the cage.\n\nPlay on CTC\n\nThanks to Cristopher Moore for testing!","solutionCode":"Row 1","tags":["Sudoku","Yin und Yang"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/t494p90vj2","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/t494p90vj2","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":2,"hasSolution":true,"features":["underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-11-16T11:36:44+00:00"}